WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.939
Rapunzel stomped around the room.

2
00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:09.020
"The witch cannot trap me here forever!

3
00:00:09.021 --> 00:00:11.216
I'll escape from this tower!

4
00:00:11.217 --> 00:00:15.864
I'll find the prince and go home!"

5
00:00:15.865 --> 00:00:22.786
Rapunzel dropped to the floor. "But how?"

6
00:00:22.787 --> 00:00:27.596
Prickle fluttered around her head.

7
00:00:27.597 --> 00:00:31.365
"I wish I could fly," Rapunzel said.

8
00:00:31.366 --> 00:00:35.155
"Oh! Maybe there's a flying potion."

9
00:00:35.156 --> 00:00:40.752
Rapunzel ran to her magic book.

10
00:00:40.753 --> 00:00:44.974
But there was no flying potion.

11
00:00:44.975 --> 00:00:48.042
"I have no rope . . . no potion . . .

12
00:00:48.043 --> 00:00:50.847
What can I do?"

13
00:00:50.848 --> 00:00:54.490
Prickle was still fluttering about.

14
00:00:54.491 --> 00:00:58.417
Suddenly Rapunzel had an idea.

15
00:00:58.418 --> 00:01:02.188
The bird often brought her things.

16
00:01:02.189 --> 00:01:05.104
"That's it!" Rapunzel cried.

17
00:01:05.105 --> 00:01:08.309
"Prickle, my hair is at the bottom of the tower.

18
00:01:08.310 --> 00:01:18.092
Can you bring it to me?"

19
00:01:18.093 --> 00:01:25.380
Prickle chirped and flew to the ground.

20
00:01:25.381 --> 00:01:28.862
He grabbed the long rope of hair.

21
00:01:28.863 --> 00:01:31.203
But it was heavy.

22
00:01:31.204 --> 00:01:37.100
He could not fly.

23
00:01:37.101 --> 00:01:39.677
Rapunzel watched him.

24
00:01:39.678 --> 00:01:43.440
"Prickle! Try a little at a time!"

25
00:01:43.441 --> 00:01:47.467
Prickle tried again.

26
00:01:47.468 --> 00:01:53.029
He flew up with some hair in his beak.

27
00:01:53.030 --> 00:01:56.900
Rapunzel clapped. "Thank you!

28
00:01:56.901 --> 00:02:02.298
Can you bring me more?"

29
00:02:02.299 --> 00:02:05.915
Prickle flew down again.

30
00:02:05.916 --> 00:02:11.266
He came back with more hair.

31
00:02:11.267 --> 00:02:18.077
He flew back and forth, again and again.

32
00:02:18.078 --> 00:02:22.808
Before long Rapunzel had a new rope.

33
00:02:22.809 --> 00:02:27.006
Quickly she made a bag from a sheet.

34
00:02:27.007 --> 00:02:30.179
She put some things in the bag.

35
00:02:30.180 --> 00:02:33.600
She tossed it out the window.

36
00:02:33.601 --> 00:02:42.246
Rapunzel tied the rope to the window and slid down.

37
00:02:42.247 --> 00:02:45.437
"I'm free!" she cried.

38
00:02:45.438 --> 00:02:49.982
"Now I will find the prince!"

39
00:02:49.983 --> 00:02:55.776
She ran through the forest.

40
00:02:55.777 --> 00:03:00.178
She searched everywhere.

41
00:03:00.179 --> 00:03:05.034
The moon was bright, but the woods were dark.

42
00:03:05.035 --> 00:03:08.397
"Prince, where are you?" she called.

43
00:03:08.398 --> 00:03:16.698
Suddenly she heard a groan.

44
00:03:16.699 --> 00:03:23.093
"The prince!" Rapunzel cried happily.

45
00:03:23.094 --> 00:03:26.439
A dark shape lay on the ground.

46
00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:30.096
But it was not the prince.

47
00:03:30.097 --> 00:03:38.764
It was . . . the witch!

